<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηλῠκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woman-like</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					747a1
				</span></i>
			; <i>like the female</i>, of male animals, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				589b30
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				961a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of women,
				<i>womanish, ultra-feminine</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρενωπός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				728a3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>feminine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					634.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Amm.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόριον</span> ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.294
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					499
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				222.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				151.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆλυς</span>
			, <i>female,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				166.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.872
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cumae</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. κεντήματα</span> bites <i>of
			female</i> vipers, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				16.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> Astrol.,
			applied to certain planets or figures of the Zodiac, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				20
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>.</div>
